                <invention-title lang="de">SAUGFÄHIGER ARTIKEL MIT KLEBEMUSTER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">ARTICLE ABSORBANT AVEC MOTIF ADHÉSIF</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ABSORBENT ARTICLE WITH ADHESIVE PATTERN</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An absorbent article having a body-facing surface and a garment-facing surface and comprising a top sheet, a back sheet, and an absorbent core and an adhesive applied to the garment facing side of back sheet as adhesive stripes oriented along the transversal axis, wherein the adhesive stripes extend over transversal width of the absorbent core. The absorbent article is intended to be folded along transversal imaginary fold lines including a first imaginary fold line arranged in a first fold region positioned between two adhesive stripes and a second imaginary fold line arranged in a second fold region positioned between two adhesive stripes, and no adhesive is present in the first and second fold regions. Further, respective longitudinal widths of the first and second fold regions are larger than the average longitudinal distance between the adhesive stripes and the width of the first fold region differs from the width of the second fold region.</p>
            </abstract>
